{"seq":3,"slug":"gene-expression","title":"高一生物 — 基因表达","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/genetics/gene-expression","wordCount":2044,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一生物-基因表达\">高一生物 — 基因表达</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>DNA 中储存的遗传信息如何转变为生物体的具体性状？这需要经过两个步骤：首先在细胞核中将 DNA 上的遗传信息&quot;抄录&quot;到 mRNA 上（转录），然后在细胞质中以 mRNA 为模板合成蛋白质（翻译）。蛋白质是生命活动的直接执行者——酶催化反应、血红蛋白运输氧气、抗体抵御病菌——因此&quot;DNA → RNA → 蛋白质&quot;这条信息流就是生命活动的核心链条，被称为<strong>中心法则</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-中心法则\">一、中心法则</h3><p>1958年，克里克提出了分子生物学的中心法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>转录</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>RNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>翻译</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>蛋白质</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{转录}} \\text{RNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{翻译}} \\text{蛋白质}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">转录</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">翻译</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">蛋白质</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>后来补充了 DNA 的复制（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DNA</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>DNA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DNA} \\to \\text{DNA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span></span></span></span></span>）和少数特殊情况：逆转录（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RNA</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>DNA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RNA} \\to \\text{DNA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span></span></span></span></span>，如 HIV 病毒）和 RNA 的复制（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RNA</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>RNA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RNA} \\to \\text{RNA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span></span></span></span></span>，如某些 RNA 病毒）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[DNA] --&gt;|复制| A&#10;    A --&gt;|转录| B[RNA]&#10;    B --&gt;|翻译| C[蛋白质]&#10;    B --&gt;|逆转录| A&#10;    B --&gt;|RNA复制| B\">graph LR\n    A[DNA] --&gt;|复制| A\n    A --&gt;|转录| B[RNA]\n    B --&gt;|翻译| C[蛋白质]\n    B --&gt;|逆转录| A\n    B --&gt;|RNA复制| B</pre><h3 id=\"二-基因与-dna-的关系\">二、基因与 DNA 的关系</h3><p><strong>基因</strong>：具有遗传效应的 DNA 片段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一条 DNA 上有许多个基因</td>\n<td>基因在 DNA 上呈线性排列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因之间有间隔区</td>\n<td>不编码蛋白质的区域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基因包括编码区和非编码区</td>\n<td>真核生物的基因有外显子（编码）和内含子（不编码）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"三-转录-从-dna-到-rna\">三、转录——从 DNA 到 RNA</h3><p><strong>定义</strong>：以 DNA 的一条链（模板链）为模板，合成 RNA 的过程。</p>\n<p><strong>场所</strong>：主要在细胞核中（线粒体和叶绿体中也可发生）</p>\n<p><strong>过程</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解旋</td>\n<td>RNA 聚合酶结合到基因的启动子上，DNA 局部解旋</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配对合成</td>\n<td>以 DNA 模板链（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27; \\to 5&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）为模板，按碱基互补配对合成 RNA（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27; \\to 3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脱离</td>\n<td>合成的 RNA 从模板上脱离，DNA 恢复双螺旋</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>转录中的碱基配对规则</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DNA 模板链碱基</th>\n<th>RNA 碱基</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>U（尿嘧啶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T</td>\n<td>A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G</td>\n<td>C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>G</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：RNA 中用 **U（尿嘧啶）**代替了 DNA 中的 T（胸腺嘧啶）。</p>\n<p><strong>三种 RNA 及其功能</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RNA 类型</th>\n<th>简写</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信使 RNA</td>\n<td>mRNA</td>\n<td>携带遗传信息，作为翻译的模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转运 RNA</td>\n<td>tRNA</td>\n<td>携带氨基酸到核糖体，识别 mRNA 上的密码子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核糖体 RNA</td>\n<td>rRNA</td>\n<td>与蛋白质组成核糖体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-遗传密码\">四、遗传密码</h3><p>mRNA 上每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个连续的碱基构成一个<strong>密码子</strong>，对应一种氨基酸（或终止信号）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 种碱基组成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个一组的密码子，共有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^3 = 64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 种组合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>61</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">61</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">61</span></span></span></span></span> 个编码氨基酸</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个为终止密码子（UAA、UAG、UGA）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个（AUG）既编码甲硫氨酸又充当起始密码子</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>密码子的特点</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通用性</td>\n<td>几乎所有生物使用相同的遗传密码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简并性</td>\n<td>一种氨基酸可能对应多个密码子（如亮氨酸有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个密码子）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无重叠性</td>\n<td>密码子之间不重叠，连续读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无间隔性</td>\n<td>密码子之间没有&quot;标点符号&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"五-翻译-从-rna-到蛋白质\">五、翻译——从 RNA 到蛋白质</h3><p><strong>定义</strong>：以 mRNA 为模板，在核糖体上将氨基酸按 mRNA 上密码子的顺序连接成多肽链的过程。</p>\n<p><strong>场所</strong>：核糖体（细胞质中）</p>\n<p><strong>过程</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起始</td>\n<td>mRNA 与核糖体结合，起始密码子（AUG）定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延伸</td>\n<td>tRNA 携带氨基酸，其反密码子与 mRNA 上的密码子互补配对，氨基酸通过肽键连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止</td>\n<td>核糖体移动到终止密码子处，多肽链释放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>tRNA 的结构与功能</strong>：</p>\n<p>tRNA 呈三叶草形结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一端携带特定的氨基酸</li>\n<li>另一端有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个碱基组成的<strong>反密码子</strong>，与 mRNA 上的密码子互补配对</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>一条 mRNA 可以同时结合多个核糖体</strong>（多聚核糖体），提高蛋白质合成效率。每个核糖体各自独立地合成一条完整的多肽链。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-从基因到性状\">六、从基因到性状</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>基因（DNA）</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>转录</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>mRNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>翻译</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>蛋白质</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>性状</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{基因（DNA）} \\xrightarrow{\\text{转录}} \\text{mRNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{翻译}} \\text{蛋白质} \\to \\text{性状}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基因（</span><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">转录</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mRNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">翻译</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">蛋白质</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">性状</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>基因控制性状的两种方式</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>直接控制</strong>：基因通过控制蛋白质的结构来直接控制性状。例如镰刀形细胞贫血症——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 珠蛋白基因突变导致血红蛋白结构异常，红细胞变成镰刀形。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>间接控制</strong>：基因通过控制酶的合成来控制代谢过程，进而控制性状。例如白化病——控制酪氨酸酶的基因突变，导致无法合成黑色素。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"七-基因突变\">七、基因突变</h3><p><strong>定义</strong>：基因中碱基对的增添、缺失或替换，导致基因结构的改变。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>对蛋白质的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碱基对替换</td>\n<td>可能改变一个氨基酸（错义突变），也可能不变（沉默突变，因密码子简并性），也可能产生终止密码子（无义突变）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碱基对增添/缺失</td>\n<td>从突变位点开始，所有密码子的读框移位（移码突变），蛋白质严重改变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>基因突变的特点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>普遍性</strong>：所有生物都可能发生基因突变</li>\n<li><strong>随机性</strong>：可以发生在任何基因的任何位置</li>\n<li><strong>不定向性</strong>：一个基因可以突变为多种等位基因</li>\n<li><strong>低频性</strong>：自然状态下突变频率很低</li>\n<li><strong>多害少利性</strong>：大多数突变有害，少数中性或有利</li>\n</ul>\n<p>基因突变是新基因产生的途径，是生物进化的根本来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"八-转录与翻译的比较\">八、转录与翻译的比较</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较项</th>\n<th>转录</th>\n<th>翻译</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模板</td>\n<td>DNA 模板链</td>\n<td>mRNA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原料</td>\n<td>核糖核苷酸</td>\n<td>氨基酸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产物</td>\n<td>mRNA（以及tRNA、rRNA）</td>\n<td>多肽链（蛋白质）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场所</td>\n<td>细胞核</td>\n<td>核糖体（细胞质）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>催化酶</td>\n<td>RNA 聚合酶</td>\n<td>多种酶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碱基配对</td>\n<td>A-U, T-A, G-C, C-G</td>\n<td>密码子-反密码子配对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某基因模板链的碱基序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-TACGGATCC-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，写出对应的 mRNA 碱基序列。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一段 mRNA 含有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 个碱基，最多能编码多少个氨基酸？实际编码的氨基酸数目为什么会少于这个值？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>如果 mRNA 上的一个密码子由 AUG 突变为 AUC，对蛋白质会有什么影响？如果突变为 UAG 呢？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么一条 mRNA 上可以同时有多个核糖体进行翻译，这对细胞有什么好处？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：为什么遗传密码具有&quot;通用性&quot;——几乎所有生物使用相同的密码子表？这暗示了什么？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>2020年诺贝尔化学奖授予了夏彭蒂埃和杜德纳，表彰她们开发的 CRISPR-Cas9 基因编辑技术。这项技术利用细菌的天然免疫系统，可以像&quot;分子剪刀&quot;一样精确地剪切和编辑 DNA 上的特定碱基序列。基因编辑技术使得科学家能够修正导致遗传病的基因突变、培育抗病虫害的农作物，甚至可能在未来治愈镰刀形细胞贫血症等遗传疾病。然而，基因编辑也带来了深刻的伦理问题——特别是涉及人类生殖细胞编辑时。2018年&quot;基因编辑婴儿&quot;事件引发了全球科学界的强烈反对和严肃讨论，凸显了科学技术必须在伦理和法律框架内负责任地发展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>基因表达包括转录（DNA → mRNA，在细胞核中进行）和翻译（mRNA → 蛋白质，在核糖体上进行）两个阶段。转录时以 DNA 模板链为模板合成 mRNA，碱基配对规则中 U 代替 T。mRNA 上每三个碱基构成一个密码子，共 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 种密码子编码 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 种氨基酸和终止信号。翻译时 tRNA 携带氨基酸，通过反密码子与密码子配对，在核糖体上合成多肽链。基因通过控制蛋白质结构或酶的合成来控制性状。基因突变是碱基对的增添、缺失或替换，是新基因产生和生物进化的根本来源。中心法则概括了遗传信息在 DNA、RNA 和蛋白质之间的流动方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一生物 — 基因表达","id":"高一生物-基因表达"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、中心法则","id":"一-中心法则"},{"level":3,"text":"二、基因与 DNA 的关系","id":"二-基因与-dna-的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"三、转录——从 DNA 到 RNA","id":"三-转录-从-dna-到-rna"},{"level":3,"text":"四、遗传密码","id":"四-遗传密码"},{"level":3,"text":"五、翻译——从 RNA 到蛋白质","id":"五-翻译-从-rna-到蛋白质"},{"level":3,"text":"六、从基因到性状","id":"六-从基因到性状"},{"level":3,"text":"七、基因突变","id":"七-基因突变"},{"level":3,"text":"八、转录与翻译的比较","id":"八-转录与翻译的比较"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一生物 — DNA结构与复制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/genetics/dna-structure"},"next":null}